  },
  "description": "The rendering context for article\u202f12345 is set up with caching enabled and a cache expiry of\u202f600\u202fseconds. It targets the web platform on a mobile device view, and the viewer\u2019s country is\u202fUS. The promotion slot in use is \u201cdesktop\u2011home\u2011sidebar,\u201d while the rendering occurs within the \u201carticle\u2011detail\u201d section. The container is identified as an article with ID\u202f12345, and the configuration follows render\u2011context version\u202f1\u20110\u20110.  \n\nIn this context the user is logged in (isLoggedIn\u202f=\u202ftrue) but ads are suppressed (_showAds\u202f=\u202ffalse). The article\u2019s price is\u202f19.99\u202fUSD with a rating of\u202f4.5. It has accumulated 12\u202f345 views and 200 shares. The author is Jane\u202fDoe and it falls under the \u201cTechnology\u201d category. Finally, the visibility flag is set to\u202f1."
}